The '''Greenhouse''' is a [[The Garden|Garden]] Plot unlocked at {{Garden|7}}. It is accessed after completing the {{NPCSprite|Carpenter}}'s offer as a [[The Garden#Visitors|Garden Visitor]] and obtaining the {{Item|Greenhouse Blueprint}}.

== Overview ==
While in the Greenhouse, players can grow different crops and water them. They will grow while offline and can be harvested once mature. The spatial configuration of nearby crops may provoke a [[Mutation]] to sprout. 

== Mechanics ==
=== Plants ===
==== Crops ====
"''Crop''" designates one of the following: {{item|Wheat}}, {{item|Carrot}}, {{item|Potato}}, {{item|Pumpkin}}, {{item|Sugar Cane}}, {{item|Melon Slice}}, {{item|Cactus}}, {{item|Cocoa Beans}}, [[File:Brown Mushroom.png|21px|link=]] [[File:Red Mushroom.png|21px|link=]] [[Mushroom]]s, {{item|Nether Wart}}, {{item|Sunflower}}, {{item|Moonflower}} and {{item|Wild Rose}}.

During its lifespan, a crop grants '''{{aqua|Effects}}''' to other plants in orthogonally adjacent planting slots (but not diagonally adjacent slots), excluding itself. All crops have {{aqua|Effects}}, categorized as {{green|buffs}} or {{red|debuffs}}.

