Additionally, all crops grant {{Skill XP|320 Farming}} when harvested.

==== Mutations ====
{{Main|Mutations}}
[[Mutations]] have a chance to grow in the Greenhouse when specific plants are arranged in specific patterns. They can be analyzed at the [[File:Crop Analyzer.png|21px|link=]] [[Crop Analyzer]], which can also be accessed from calling {{NPC|Jake}}.

Upon harvesting a [[Mutation]], one has a chance to drop {{Item|Ethereal Vine|amount=1}}, which is used to unlock more plants slots in the Greenhouse. Once all plants slots are unlocked, they can also be used to unlock a 2nd and 3rd Greenhouse.
* Second Greenhouse slot costs {{Item|Ethereal Vine|amount=100}} and {{Item|Compost Bundle|amount=10}}.
* Third Greenhouse slot costs {{Item|Ethereal Vine|amount=150}} and {{Item|Compost Bundle|amount=20}}.

Similarly to Crops, [[Mutations]] can inflict and be affected by {{Aqua|Effects}}.

==== Dead Plant ====
{{Main|Dead Plant}}
{{See also|#Decaying}}
When a plant decays, a {{item|Dead Plant}} replaces it. Natively, it has no {{Aqua|Effect}}. It can further decay into nothingness.

